    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 9 Kinsealy Manor Drive is an exceptional three-bedroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned within the highly regarded, family-friendly Kinsealy Woods development on Chapel Road, just off the Malahide Road. \r\nBuilt in 2020, this impressive A2-rated home offers bright, spacious and beautifully finished accommodation, complemented by high-quality fixtures and fittings throughout. With high ceilings, modern energy-efficient technology and a quiet cul-de-sac setting.\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with clever \"Dragons' Den\"-style understairs storage, guest WC, comfortable living room, utility room and an impressive open-plan kitchen/dining area featuring an abundance of storage and excellent space for both everyday family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three generous bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with ensuite, together with a family bathroom. A large, partially floored attic provides valuable additional storage and is easily accessed via a pull-down ladder.\r\n\r\nKinsealy Woods enjoys an excellent location within easy reach of both Malahide and Portmarnock Villages, offering convenient access to an extensive range of shops, restaurants, cafés, schools, sporting and recreational amenities. Portmarnock Beach and the picturesque Malahide Castle & Demesne are also within easy reach. For commuters, the location provides excellent connectivity, with convenient access to the M1 and M50 motorways, Dublin Airport and a regular bus service to Dublin City Centre."
      },
      {
